0..70 Comment "//! `independent` forks two tasks whose plays do not order each other."
71..74 Comment "//!"
75..148 Comment "//! Each task sends notes on its end. Each channel web is series-parallel"
149..220 Comment "//! without a prime node, whatever order the parent joins the tasks in."
221..224 Comment "//!"
225..305 Comment "//! The parent joins the tasks in reverse fork order. The annotations state each"
306..332 Comment "//! channel\'s prime count."
333..336 Comment "//!"
337..406 Comment "//! - see: `forced.gandr` — a task whose reply waits on its request"
407..483 Comment "//! - see: #3338 — the run trace and the web a source states for a channel"
